CHIP MATRIX MACH111
PIN 10 A
PIN 32 B
PIN 14 C
PIN 15 D
PIN 16 E
PIN 17 F
PIN 11 CLK
PIN 2 Q0 REG
PIN 3 Q1 REG
PIN 4 Q2 REG
PIN 5 Q3 
EQUATIONS
Q0=/A*B*/C*/E+/A*/C*/D*F+A*/B*C*/E+/B*/E*/F+A*/D*/E+/A*E*F+A*E
Q0.CLKF=CLK
Q1.T=A*B*D*/E+/C*/D*E*F+A*B*/E+B*C*/E+/C*E+A*D*E*/F+A*/B*/C*/F
Q1.CLKF=CLK
Q2=(B*D*E+/A*/D*E*F+B*F+A*B*E*F+A*D*/E+/A*C*D+A*F) :+: F
Q2.CLKF=CLK
Q3=A*D+C*D*E*/F+B*/E+/E*/F+B*/C*E*/F+/C*D+A*/B*C*/F
